{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S05-1\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"写的是他对对方心意的疑问，以及认识到自己的快乐不能证明对方的心意，没有新增人物关系、外部事件或把珠子的漂浮意象写成真实场景。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S05-2\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"回看 S04-5 中自己曾有的保证，并写出由此产生的难堪和动机怀疑，没有新增前史、对白或具体处境。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S05-3\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"区分了关心对方时真实的快乐与是否期待回报，没有把珠子的比喻写成实际发生的事，也没有添加外部事实。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S05-4\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"将对亲近能否持续的疑虑、面对难堪的态度和留住亲近的冲动写成心理变化，没有把珠子里的松手写成真实动作，也没有把音乐变化当作心理原因。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"links\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S03-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S05-1\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S03-4 已明确他偶尔想知道自己在对方心里是否特别，S05-1 是这个愿望在欢喜稍退后的延续。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S05-1\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S04-5 把不提要求当成不会失去亲近的保证，S05-1 意识到自己的快乐不能证明对方的心意，正好动摇了这份保证。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S05-2\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"回想自己曾以为不求回应就不会失去，直接引出了对这份保证的动摇、难堪和对自身动机的怀疑。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S05-3\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S04-2 已明确关心对方本身就能使他快乐，为 S05-3 确认先前快乐真实存在提供了直接理由。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S05-3\",\n      \"label\": \"勉强\",\n      \"why\": \"S04-3 中不再盘算付出多少、内心感到充实，能够支持快乐来自关心本身，但不盘算付出并不能单独证明他没有暗中期待被珍惜。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S05-4\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S02-4 已建立他希望舒服的当下延长的愿望，S05-4 写的是同一份想留住亲近的劲头仍在、只是减弱。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"不看珠子也能读出完整的心理过程：欢喜退去后想知道对方的心意，继而怀疑自己的动机，同时确认先前的快乐是真实的，最后不再急于用辩解或热情维持亲近。\"\n  ,\n  \"lost\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\n        \"R22\"\n      ],\n      \"what\": \"R22 中明确承认说自己毫无所求并不诚实的心理事实丢失了；S05-2 只写他怀疑自己是否暗盼被珍惜，没有真正承认自己并非毫无所求，而 S05-3 保留的只是先前快乐并非为了换取回应这一层。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"unexplained\": [],\n  \"wordy\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b2fe5ced-34ea-409f-bdb6-5ba8d24d4905", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T113555832827Z", "elapsed_seconds": 420.266, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T11:42:56.105994+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "1ffa41dd68b7e22ad269fa103d9ca236c557de765d69b3c62db7d4449d85756e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T113555832827Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "6ae617344aed9db6ddfe56617a1b8b13775deb1afb909d4130168857206c79e3"}}}
